    "turn_idx": 26,
    "turn_text": "No. And it's very there's a duality there. There is South Carolina Cunningham and there's DC Cunningham. And what you hear isn't what you actually see when you're in DC. They're two totally different people. And we were promised a lot, like most politicians, when they run for office, serve you a platter of BS. And he did the same thing. He said it would always be low country over party, but since he's been elected, it's been party over low country. And the low country has had a history of having representation that really has a truly independent streak. And that's what we were promised, but that's not what we were delivered.",
