        "text": "The Paycheck Protection Program (PPP) distributed funds to Ivy League universities and large corporations rather than small businesses.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Sending money to deceased individuals is unacceptable and unsustainable.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Many independent business owners were unable to access the Independent Employer Development Loan (IEDL).",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Maintaining public health and safety is a top priority.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "There was insufficient accountability in how relief funds were distributed.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "A functioning economy is essential during the pandemic.",
