      },
      {
        "text": "Being in quarantine at home for a prolonged period has been detrimental to mental and physical health.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Children are not significant spreaders of the virus compared to adults.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "My child had very mild symptoms after contracting the virus—only a stuffy nose and slight fatigue for two days.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "It is difficult for children to transmit the virus to others.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Children are less severely affected by the illness if they contract it.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The timing suggests I likely passed the virus to my child, not the other way around.",
